upervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T20:50:27-08:00","id":1424161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1423253-modiphius-is-bo-longer-the-publisher-of-vtm-renegade-studios-is?p=1424148#post1424148\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why not?<br /> <br /> We've had two more Antediluvains added to the original 13. There's also potentially many more.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Vampire has always had lots of <i>Bloodlines,</i> but having 13 Clans seemed to be symbolic and linked to biblical/occult references.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T21:07:12-08:00","id":1424164,"title":"","content":"It's just a number.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T21:13:16-08:00","id":1424168,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1423253-modiphius-is-bo-longer-the-publisher-of-vtm-renegade-studios-is?p=1424164#post1424164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's just a number.</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s a number that has always been used in the game, as a point of referencing its symbolism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T23:28:07-08:00","id":1424185,"title":"","content":"Bruh, it's just a number.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T00:08:53-08:00","id":1424191,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s a number that every previous edition of the game made a big deal of. It is why they have always quite explicitly referred to \u201c13 Clans\u201d in every edition of the game - including the first edition, even though we didn\u2019t know who the other six were. It is also why they developed the term \u201cBloodline\u201d to refer to lineages of vampire outside of the 13 Clans, and why the Tremere\u2019s ascent significantly was diablerie at the expense of the Salubri. It was a number that added to the atmosphere of the game, giving it a biblical/occult feel as much as trying to link the lore of the game to Cain and the 13 Antediluvians. <br /> <br /> Now people are saying, &quot;it\u2019s just a number\u201d. Great. To me, it\u2019s just a meta plot development to ignore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T00:42:36-08:00","id":1424194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1423253-modiphius-is-bo-longer-the-publisher-of-vtm-renegade-studios-is?p=1424168#post1424168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It\u2019s a number that has always been used in the game, as a point of referencing its symbolism.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know. I started playing V:tM In 1991. I just don't think it's mandatory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T00:48:50-08:00","id":1424195,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1423253-modiphius-is-bo-longer-the-publisher-of-vtm-renegade-studios-is?p=1424194#post1424194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know. I started playing V:tM In 1991. I just don't think it's mandatory.</div> </div> </div> </div>Frankly, it should be. It is a canon part of the game - and it\u2019s significant to the lore of the game. The game is based on a superstitious premise and biblical undertones. Ditching the 13 Clans motif affects the atmosphere of the game, and it should at least have some form of explanation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T00:52:28-08:00","id":1424197,"title":"","content":"I think it the symbolism of 13 is very culture specific and laughably cliche in this day and age.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T01:16:47-08:00","id":1424202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1423253-modiphius-is-bo-longer-the-publisher-of-vtm-renegade-studios-is?p=1424197#post1424197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it the symbolism of 13 is very culture specific and laughably cliche in this day and age.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it\u2019s not. The number 13 is considered significant in many cultures:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>13 in the number of attendees at the last supper</li> <li>13 is the number of full moons per year</li> <li>13 is the Jewish coming of age in years, and has other cultural meanings</li> <li>13 is the number of the Death card in Tarot.</li> <li>13 is the number of witches in a coven</li> <li>13 is the number of Terah in Hindi</li> <li>13 is the number of Confucian Classics (I Ching, etc)</li> <li>13 is the smallest emery number, a prime number, a happy number, a Fibonacci number and is mathematically significant in a bunch of ways</li> <li>13 is the number of Archemedean solids in geometry</li> <li>The 13th day of various particular Months is considered significant across a load of religions, ancient and current.</li> <li>13 is considered lucky in some cultures and unlucky in others.</li> <li>Friday the 13th is a bad horror movie series, but is nevertheless another reference.</li> <li>13 is the number of Clans in Vampire: The Masquerade</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T02:10:36-08:00","id":1424212,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1423253-modiphius-is-bo-longer-the-publisher-of-vtm-renegade-studios-is?p=1424125#post1424125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll keep to objective facts then<br /> the Camarilla is still brutally terrifying,did you know that in one v5 book,Prince Marc Decker rules his city in very orwellian manner and everyone is scared of him? And Kevin Jackson controls all gangs of Chicago?.modern technology has only been avoided due to vampire hunters. Keep in mind the Anarchs have indeed been changed fom a non threat to a big threat indeed,you should remember they got three new clans,each with a reason for joining them. The anarchs have become a full blown sect,just as dangerous as any other.<br /> And again,the Sabbat were not shipped away so much as they are being saved for later,their book is officially being developed.</div> </div> </div> </div>the sabbat totally abandoned their holdings, and had at least one (probably) 2 of their clans leave...for no logical reasons at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T02:27:13-08:00","id":1424217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1423253-modiphius-is-bo-longer-the-publisher-of-vtm-renegade-studios-is?p=1424202#post1424202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, it\u2019s not. The number 13 is considered significant in many cultures:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>13 in the number of attendees at the last supper</li> <li>13 is the number of full moons per year</li> <li>13 is the Jewish coming of age in years, and has other cultural meanings</li> <li>13 is the number of the Death card in Tarot.</li> <li>13 is the number of witches in a coven</li> <li>13 is the number of Terah in Hindi</li> <li>13 is the number of Confucian Classics (I Ching, etc)</li> <li>13 is the smallest emery number, a prime number, a happy number, a Fibonacci number and is mathematically significant in a bunch of ways</li> <li>13 is the number of Archemedean solids in geometry</li> <li>The 13th day of various particular Months is considered significant across a load of religions, ancient and current.</li> <li>13 is considered lucky in some cultures and unlucky in others.</li> <li>Friday the 13th is a bad horror movie series, but is nevertheless another reference.</li> <li>13 is the number of Clans in Vampire: The Masquerade</li> </ol></div> </div> </div> </div>literally all numbers are significant when you stretch like this and end up looking for stuff. but why should vampires be beholden to this? The Tremere can obsess over 7 all they want, but you think the 2nd generation were co-operating to get 3rd gen numbers they liked?<br /> <br /> I find it funny that this is the time you draw a line when it comes to v5 changing stuff. you've been so overwhelmingly positive so far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T03:25:58-08:00","id":1424229,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1423253-modiphius-is-bo-longer-the-publisher-of-vtm-renegade-studios-is?p=1424217#post1424217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> literally all numbers are significant when you stretch like this and end up looking for stuff. but why should vampires be beholden to this? The Tremere can obsess over 7 all they want, but you think the 2nd generation were co-operating to get 3rd gen numbers they liked?<br /> <br /> I find it funny that this is the time you draw a line when it comes to v5 changing stuff. you've been so overwhelmingly positive so far.</div> </div> </div> </div>No they are not. No other number could replace \u201913\u2019 in any of the contexts listed above. And we aren\u2019t talking about the Tremere, we are talking about how many Clans have always been in Vampire: The Masquerade, with the specific distinction between Clans and Bloodlines underlining the significance of 13 Clans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/